  {
   "id": "cl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 818,
   "width": 826,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100035,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700245,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The client computes the URL - and pays for it with a near-permanent convention",
   "originalText": "The client computes the URL - and pays for it with a near-permanent convention",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 856,
   "width": 1027,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100036,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700252,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Panning and zooming are continuous gestures generating tile requests many times per second. An intermediate 'resolve my tiles'\ncall would add a round trip to every gesture - and a round trip to a SERVER, whereas the tile fetches themselves go to a nearby\nCDN edge. You would be adding the slowest hop in the system to the most frequent operation in the product.",
   "originalText": "Panning and zooming are continuous gestures generating tile requests many times per second. An intermediate 'resolve my tiles'\ncall would add a round trip to every gesture - and a round trip to a SERVER, whereas the tile fetches themselves go to a nearby\nCDN edge. You would be adding the slowest hop in the system to the most frequent operation in the product.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "frozen",
