   "locked": false,
   "text": "so (z,x,y) addressing, Web Mercator and 256-pixel tiles are effectively FROZEN AT LAUNCH",
   "originalText": "so (z,x,y) addressing, Web Mercator and 256-pixel tiles are effectively FROZEN AT LAUNCH",
