   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ver_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 38,
   "y": 2211,
   "width": 804,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100091,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700637,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "/v41/{z}/{x}/{y}.mvt        <- current\n/v42/{z}/{x}/{y}.mvt        <- published alongside; nothing invalidated\n\nGET /v1/map/version  ->  { 'tiles_version': 42 }   <- the ONE thing clients poll",
   "originalText": "/v41/{z}/{x}/{y}.mvt        <- current\n/v42/{z}/{x}/{y}.mvt        <- published alongside; nothing invalidated\n\nGET /v1/map/version  ->  { 'tiles_version': 42 }   <- the ONE thing clients poll",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "ver",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "fn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 2186,
   "width": 591,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100092,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700644,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "You would have to enumerate affected tiles, issue purges to every PoP, and wait\nfor eventual propagation with no reliable completion signal. So updates are\nVERSIONED, NOT PURGED.",
   "originalText": "You would have to enumerate affected tiles, issue purges to every PoP, and wait\nfor eventual propagation with no reliable completion signal. So updates are\nVERSIONED, NOT PURGED.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "fn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 2246,
   "width": 606,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100093,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700651,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Publishing v42 invalidates nothing. Clients discover it through one tiny version\nendpoint (itself cached with a short TTL) and start requesting the new prefix.\nOld tiles stay valid for clients that have not checked yet, so THERE IS NO MOMENT\nOF INCONSISTENCY - a client is always on exactly one coherent version.",
   "originalText": "Publishing v42 invalidates nothing. Clients discover it through one tiny version\nendpoint (itself cached with a short TTL) and start requesting the new prefix.\nOld tiles stay valid for clients that have not checked yet, so THERE IS NO MOMENT\nOF INCONSISTENCY - a client is always on exactly one coherent version.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "fn3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 2320,
   "width": 1027,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100094,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700658,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And rollback is a POINTER CHANGE: set the version endpoint back to 41. Nothing needs re-uploading or re-warming, because v41 is\nstill cached everywhere. Compare purge-based invalidation, where a bad publish means re-purging and then re-warming trillions\nof objects from a cold origin.",
   "originalText": "And rollback is a POINTER CHANGE: set the version endpoint back to 41. Nothing needs re-uploading or re-warming, because v41 is\nstill cached everywhere. Compare purge-based invalidation, where a bad publish means re-purging and then re-warming trillions\nof objects from a cold origin.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "fn4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 2394,
   "width": 1019,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100095,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700665,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The costs are honest ones. Storage multiplies with retained versions - mitigated by content-addressed dedup, since v41 and v42\nshare every unchanged tile, so a new version costs only the tiles that actually changed. And v42 STARTS COLD at the edges, so\na publish causes a temporary origin load spike as popular tiles are re-fetched; staging the version endpoint's rollout by\nregion turns that spike into a ramp.",
   "originalText": "The costs are honest ones. Storage multiplies with retained versions - mitigated by content-addressed dedup, since v41 and v42\nshare every unchanged tile, so a new version costs only the tiles that actually changed. And v42 STARTS COLD at the edges, so\na publish causes a temporary origin load spike as popular tiles are re-fetched; staging the version endpoint's rollout by\nregion turns that spike into a ramp.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
 ],
